# Never commit real environment files anywhere in this repo, including
# node_modules mirrors and backup/snapshot directories -- they've leaked
# real-looking API keys/DB passwords more than once. .env.example and
# similar template files are unaffected (different filename).
**/.env

# Vendored/generated content -- never belongs in git history. A stray
# compiled binary under node_modules once exceeded GitHub's 100MB file
# limit and blocked every push until history was rewritten to remove it.
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.next/
